Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root (Cursor also reads it natively). Key rules, repeated so they survive long chats:

- TOP RULE: everything visible is a real, editable Studio instance; runtime scripts only clone/show/hide/fill/tween.
- Tunables are attributes (`ReplicatedStorage.Config.GameSettings` or on the instance), seeded only if missing.
- New UI clones existing styled templates. Phone fixes: fit only — "DON'T CHANGE THE DESIGN".
- The owner's design numbers are final; list disagreements as "your call", never change them yourself.
- Loop: read QUEUE.md → plan → smallest change → build → test (new test fails on base) → PC+phone shots → publish per
  rule → QUEUE `DONE` line → short report with the Roblox version number.
- Honesty: Verified (real Studio/device) vs Automated-only (Lune tests, rig shots) vs Unverified.
- No secrets in files. Never publish over Studio-only edits. 409 on publish → retry with backoff.
- Tools: `tools/rig/go.sh`, `shot.sh`, `fast.sh`, `run_all.sh`, `compare_runs.sh`, `publish.sh`, `prices.sh`.
